<title>USA: Emisphere sees Lilly pact trials within yr.</title>
<headline>Emisphere sees Lilly pact trials within yr.</headline>
<byline>Susan Spielberg</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emisphere Technolgies Inc sees starting clinical trials of at least one product from its alliance with Eli Lilly and Co to use its technology for the delivery of Lilly proteins within a year.</p>
<p>&quot;The first product could be in clincals within a year,&quot; said Michael Goldberg, Emisphere's chairman and chief executive officer in a telephone interview.</p>
</text>
